This project adapts material from vdaubry/bottega
(https://github.com/vdaubry/bottega), used under the MIT License.
bottega-kit takes bottega's process (spec-first planning, a human gate on the
plan, an implementer and a reviewer alternating over one task document). It
does not take bottega's platform (web server, database, user interface).

Files adapted from vdaubry/bottega (HEAD 7e5137f, 2026-10-05):

  reference/server/constants/templates/plan-template.md -> templates/task.md
  reference/server/constants/prompts/planification.md   -> prompts/planner.md
  reference/server/constants/prompts/implementation.md  -> prompts/implementer.md
  reference/server/constants/prompts/review.md          -> prompts/reviewer.md

prompts/judge.md is original to bottega-kit.

